# Blog & forum — Apex reference

**Canonical UI:** [cheatsapexlegends.org](https://cheatsapexlegends.org/) — source repo `cheats_apexlegends_.com`.

When editing blog or forum pages, components, CSS, or scripts on **rust-hacks.com**:

1. **Do not** invent new layout (e.g. Reddit card forum). Use Apex patterns: blog index grid + tag filters; article sidebar; forum **table** index with `ForumDiscussionsSearch`, hero stats, category chips.
2. Before large changes, **diff** the same file under `cheats_apexlegends_.com/src/`.
3. New posts go in `src/content/blog/{locale}/*.md`; new threads in `src/data/forum.ts` `rawPosts`.
4. Keep Rust-specific **copy** only; structure and class names stay aligned with Apex.
